*** Begin Patch
*** Add File: buildroot-external/board/radxa/rock5b/patches/linux/0001-move-if-to-visibility-cdns3-kconfig.patch
+From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: HAOS-build-fix <haos-bot@example.com>
+Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
+Subject: [PATCH] Kconfig: move 'if !USB_GADGET' to config visibility for cdns3
+
+This patch fixes invalid Kconfig syntax 'depends on ... if'. The intent is to
+make the Cadence USB3 driver visible only when USB_GADGET is not set while
+keeping its dependency on USB. Move the 'if !USB_GADGET' clause to the
+config visibility instead of appending it to the depends line.
+
+Signed-off-by: HAOS-build-fix <haos-bot@example.com>
+
*** End Patch
+
*** Begin Patch
*** Update File: drivers/usb/cdns3/Kconfig
@@
-config USB_CDNS3
-    tristate "Cadence USB3 driver"
-    depends on USB if !USB_GADGET
+config USB_CDNS3
+    tristate "Cadence USB3 driver" if !USB_GADGET
+    depends on USB
*** End Patch
